  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.4.0\n\n      New Features:\n      - Fluent MessageFactoryBuilder API for code-first configuration without XML. Supports headers, templates with inheritance, parse maps with inheritance and exclusion, composite fields, custom fields, and all factory properties.\n\n      Performance:\n      - Bitmap128 struct backed by UInt128 replaces BitArray for field-presence tracking with zero heap allocations.\n      - Span and ReadOnlySpan used throughout parsing and encoding for zero-copy byte/string conversions.\n      - Zero-copy byte utilities via MemoryMarshal.Cast; Stringx extensions encode directly into destination buffers.\n      - EncodingCache and ArrayPool pooled variants reduce allocations on hot paths.\n      - All parsers, IsoMessage, IsoValue, MessageFactory, and codecs updated to use span-based APIs.\n\n      Breaking Changes:\n      - NetCore8583.Util namespace reorganised into NetCore8583.Extensions. Update using statements if you reference HexCodec, Bcd, Arrays, OsUtil, or other utilities directly.\n      - Removed: ByteUtil, DateUtil, StringUtil from NetCore8583.Util (replaced by equivalents in NetCore8583.Extensions).",
